 "web": "These land on the same household at once. One family: water arrives some days through a hose system the neighbors built, and they buy drinking water by the jug; the tobacco is sold at the company's price; the oldest son drives a motoconcho in Santiago, off the books; a daughter in New York sends money most months; the grandmother has no pension; the October rains flood the lower field and there is no insurance; the land has no registered title, so the money to replant comes from a *prestamista* at 20% a month. No single barrier decided this family's year. Together they set the price.",
